Framesmith
Framesmith is a modified version of FilmCraft (https://github.com/storytold/filmcraft): a touch
layout for phones and tablets (crates/ui-egui/src/mobile), an Android app (apps/framesmith-android,
android/), and its own name, mark and colours. Modifications copyright (c) 2026 Shohan, under the
same MIT OR Apache-2.0 terms. Framesmith is not affiliated with or endorsed by the ArtCraft Team.

The ArtCraft name, wordmark and logos are trademarks of the ArtCraft Team. As their brand licence
requires of forks, they have been removed from Framesmith (docs/brand/ is not included).

